    "detailed_description": "Play as a newly born <strong>Small Cell</strong> trying to understand the purpose of its existence in an environment populated by many other cells and many secrets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163250/extras/eb4ceb970f426c645c9026f3037d703f.avif?t=1709043040\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A single-player adventure in search of the meaning of life and the understanding of difference</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A well-thought-out level design with varied and challenging mechanics that require both skill and reflection</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A small world, small in terms of the cells that live in it, but large in terms of its many levels 100+ </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A lot of bonuses to collect in order to unlock new powers, hidden areas,...</li></ul><br><i>Jump, air-dash, mix cells.</i><br><br>With simple and really enjoyable controls, but with increasing difficulty, death will be a learning experience. In this cellular environment, use the multiple capabilities of the <strong>Small Cell</strong> to progress and advance through the adventure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2163250/extras/74535a9972d1b5b1e59d94cfd46f9c20.avif?t=1709043040\" /></div><br><br>Additional challenges for the most adventurous players are available once Hard Modes are unlocked.",
